mkuse!{use crate :: marker :: { PointeeSized , Unsize } ;}
mkitem!{mktrait!{# [doc = " Trait that indicates that this is a pointer or a wrapper for one,"] # [doc = " where unsizing can be performed on the pointee."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " See the [DST coercion RFC][dst-coerce] and [the nomicon entry on coercion][nomicon-coerce]"] # [doc = " for more details."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " For builtin pointer types, pointers to `T` will coerce to pointers to `U` if `T: Unsize<U>`"] # [doc = " by converting from a thin pointer to a fat pointer."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " For custom types, the coercion here works by coercing `Foo<T>` to `Foo<U>`"] # [doc = " provided an impl of `CoerceUnsized<Foo<U>> for Foo<T>` exists."] # [doc = " Such an impl can only be written if `Foo<T>` has only a single non-phantomdata"] # [doc = " field involving `T`. If the type of that field is `Bar<T>`, an implementation"] # [doc = " of `CoerceUnsized<Bar<U>> for Bar<T>` must exist. The coercion will work by"] # [doc = " coercing the `Bar<T>` field into `Bar<U>` and filling in the rest of the fields"] # [doc = " from `Foo<T>` to create a `Foo<U>`. This will effectively drill down to a pointer"] # [doc = " field and coerce that."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " Generally, for smart pointers you will implement"] # [doc = " `CoerceUnsized<Ptr<U>> for Ptr<T> where T: Unsize<U>, U: ?Sized`, with an"] # [doc = " optional `?Sized` bound on `T` itself. For wrapper types that directly embed `T`"] # [doc = " like `Cell<T>` and `RefCell<T>`, you"] # [doc = " can directly implement `CoerceUnsized<Wrap<U>> for Wrap<T> where T: CoerceUnsized<U>`."] # [doc = " This will let coercions of types like `Cell<Box<T>>` work."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " [`Unsize`][unsize] is used to mark types which can be coerced to DSTs if behind"] # [doc = " pointers. It is implemented automatically by the compiler."] # [doc = ""] # [doc = " [dst-coerce]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/0982-dst-coercion.md"] # [doc = " [unsize]: crate::marker::Unsize"] # [doc = " [nomicon-coerce]: ../../nomicon/coercions.html"] # [unstable (feature = "coerce_unsized" , issue = "18598")] # [lang = "coerce_unsized"] pub trait CoerceUnsized < T : PointeeSized > { }}}
mkitem!{mkimpl!{# [unstable (feature = "coerce_unsized" , issue = "18598")] impl < 'a , T : PointeeSized + Unsize < U > , U : PointeeSized > CoerceUnsized < & 'a mut U > for & 'a mut T { }}}
